notes = "The five actual playable breath types retain the delivered public readiness gate and mapped direct constructors. The selected violet-astral Dragon uses the supplied per-pose mouth pixels and exact selected768 source registration, preserving body receiving slots and each phase's full adaptive inputs. Rear-occluded and unauthored poses remain unavailable. Eight other damage-type sources and the optional new512 body remain unselected. Actual condition UUID, ready/breath_type, observation revision and existing owner/phase clocks remain authoritative; ready=false retires readiness without requiring mouth geometry. This mouth readiness does not implement finite breath firing. Artwork remains unreviewed."
